          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p><strong>In the following sentence, some parts have been printed in bold. One of the bold parts is incorrectly spelt. Pick up that part and choose its number. If there is no error in the bold parts, choose option 5- no error as the answer. </strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Jugding</strong> the <strong>legality</strong> of the&nbsp;<strong>ordinance</strong>&nbsp;is within the <strong>province</strong> of the courts.</p>",
