          "correctOptionId": "1",
          "marks": 0.5,
          "negativeMarks": 0.125,
          "explanation": "<p>The correct answer is &#39;<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Deimagogue</span></strong>&#39;.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/key-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Key Points</u></span><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&#39;Deimagogue&#39; is incorrectly spelled.</span></li>\n\t<li>The correct word is <strong>&#39;Demagogue&#39; </strong>which means <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">a political leader who seeks support by appealing to popular desires and prejudices rather than by using the rational argument. </span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Therefore,</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); \">&nbsp;the correct answer is</span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"> <strong>&#39;option 1&#39;.</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span><span style=\"font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Let&#39;s have a look at other correct words.</li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><strong>Recreant-</strong>&nbsp;cowardly. and unfaithful to a cause.&nbsp;</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><strong>Vacant-</strong>&nbsp;empty.&nbsp;</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><strong>Vanity-</strong>&nbsp;excessive pride in or admiration of one&#39;s own appearance or achievements.</span></li>\n\t<li><strong>Litter-</strong><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">&nbsp;rubbish such as paper, cans, and bottles left lying in an open or public place.</span></li>\n</ul>",
